  "details": "Hope this wouldn't be too rife for abuse, but I'd love it if VRChat auto-populated some of the information like my username and the offending user's Username when using the in-game report system and it just sends me to the Report page.\n\nSome people have weird characters in their names, or long ones that I can't transcribe while I'm still in VR, making it hard for me to actually report someone for harassment.\n\nIt would be nice if those fields were already filled when I hit Report.",
